                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَطَنٌ</span></b> 
                         The <i>place of abode</i> or <i>residence</i> (S,
Mgh, K) of a man: (S, Mgh:) a man's <i>settled
place of abode;</i> his <i>place of constant residence;</i>
his <i>dwelling;</i> his <i>home.</i> (Msb)

